---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Best Country for Africans to Migrate To | AfriMigrate"
  description="Explore the best migration destinations for Africans — Canada, UK, Australia, and where AfriMigrate is expanding next: Germany, the Netherlands, and Portugal."
>
  <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Destinations</div>
  <div class="eyebrow">Destinations</div>
  <h1>Where do you want to go?</h1>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
    There's no single "best" country — it depends on your profession, savings, and whether you already have a job offer. Here's an honest look at each destination AfriMigrate covers, plus what's coming next.
  </p>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="tools-grid">
      <div class="tool-card">
        <div class="hot">Live</div>
        <div class="tool-icon">🇨🇦</div>
        <h3>Canada</h3>
        <p>The most transparent points-based system. No job offer needed for Express Entry, and 11 provinces run their own nominee programs.</p>
        <a href="/canada" class="tool-link">Explore Canada →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="tool-card">
        <div class="tool-icon">🇬🇧</div>
        <h3>United Kingdom</h3>
        <p>Sponsor-led system best for professionals in healthcare, IT, engineering and education who can secure a licensed sponsor.</p>
        <a href="/uk" class="tool-link">Explore the UK →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="tool-card">
        <div class="tool-icon">🇦🇺</div>
        <h3>Australia</h3>
        <p>Skills-first, points-tested system with no job offer required for the main independent visa.</p>
        <a href="/australia" class="tool-link">Explore Australia →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="tool-card">
        <div class="tool-icon">🇩🇪</div>
        <h3>Germany</h3>
        <p>The EU Blue Card and Opportunity Card are opening up fast-growing routes for skilled and IT professionals.</p>
        <span class="tool-link muted">Guide coming soon</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tool-card">
        <div class="tool-icon">🇳🇱</div>
        <h3>Netherlands</h3>
        <p>A strong highly-skilled migrant scheme with employer sponsorship and a favourable tax regime for newcomers.</p>
        <span class="tool-link muted">Guide coming soon</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tool-card">
        <div class="tool-icon">🇵🇹</div>
        <h3>Portugal</h3>
        <p>Popular for its Job Seeker visa and D-series routes, with a relatively accessible path to EU residency.</p>
        <span class="tool-link muted">Guide coming soon</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="eyebrow">Not Sure Yet?</div>
    <h2>Compare them side by side</h2>
    <p class="lead">See cost, timeline, and job offer requirements for Canada, UK and Australia in one table.</p>
    <a href="/compare" class="btn-primary" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Compare destinations →</a>
  </section>
</Layout>
